Subject: [PATCH 13/33] Decode block selection on gfx11: register top-k by rows
 (STRATA_TOPK_ROWS) and the DPP16 scorer (STRATA_SCORES_DPP), on for gfx1100

Ported from opt7 (ad4b6f5e 4d9def71 a64ecb5e 9ae2279c) onto v0.2.9's selection code: the kernels sit beside
v0.2.9's register, wide and rows kernels and take only the decode calls (no block count) on gfx11.
qsa_topk_parity --selftest passes (special values, graph replay); at a 262144 capacity, 8 queries, the
decode top-k is 0.088 ms against v0.2.9's wide kernel 0.137 ms (STRATA_TOPK_ROWS=0).
